  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Bug Focus</p>\n<p>Both you and your bugs have a propensity to get riled up when things don't go your way.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever a creature makes a successful saving throw against one of your bugs, you get a +1 morale bonus to attack and damage rolls against that creature for 2 rounds. This bonus applies both to your physical attacks, as well as to all attack and damage rolls made by bugs you activate.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/herbalism-feats#toc0\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
